        "text": "All configuration is via environment variables. See for a fully commented example. Required variables: Variable Description PostgreSQL connection string Random secret for signing JWTs — min 32 chars Random secret for desktop launcher tokens 64 hex chars (32 bytes) for AES 256 GCM — encrypts TOTP secrets Public URL of the web app (e.g. ) Public URL of the API — usually same as Generate secrets with:"
